    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the password_reset.py file, I need to integrate with an external provider for the password reset flow. I will use Amazon Cognito as the external provider since it is a concrete service that can handle user authentication and password resets. I will import the necessary modules from the boto3 library to interact with Amazon Cognito. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789887006293,
          "start": 1789887003957
