      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `refresh_session.py` file that refreshes an expired session or access token using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a specific provider and use its identifiable elements in the code. For this task, I will use the Google OAuth 2.0 service, which is a widely used authentication protocol. The identifiable elements will be the import of the `google-auth` library and the use of Google-specific OAuth endpoints. </thinking>\n\n",
